{#
  "Wieder lieferbar" (Block G, G12, G15): one mail per wish, then the wish is
  gone (StockNoticeCron).

  The link leads to the product page and carries a token of
  EmailConfirmation: signed in as the account, a button there confirms the
  address (Michael, 2026-10-05: "der Rücklink kann zur Verifizierung der
  E-Mail-Adresse genutzt werden"). Opening the link confirms nothing — mail
  filters open links to inspect them.

  No name in the salutation: the account's name is whatever its holder typed
  (Fable review D-4, S1).

  Loaded as @Contao/mail/consho_stock_available.html.twig. Parameters are a
  LIST (vsprintf).

  Variables:
    product  the product's title, plain text
    link     the product page, token included
#}
{% block subject %}{{ 'CONSHO.mail.stockAvailable.subject'|trans([product], 'contao_default') }}{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
{% set font = 'font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #222222;' %}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #f4f4f4;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding: 24px 12px;">
{% include '@Contao/mail/_frame_head.html.twig' %}
<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background: #ffffff; {{ font }}">
<tr><td style="padding: 24px 28px;">

<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.confirmEmail.hello'|trans({}, 'contao_default') }}</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.stockAvailable.intro'|trans([product], 'contao_default') }}</p>

<p style="margin: 24px 0;">
    <a href="{{ link }}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; background: #222222; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 3px;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.stockAvailable.button'|trans({}, 'contao_default') }}</a>
</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.stockAvailable.once'|trans({}, 'contao_default') }}</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #555555;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.stockAvailable.confirm'|trans({}, 'contao_default') }}</p>

</td></tr>
</table>
{% include '@Contao/mail/_frame_foot.html.twig' %}
</td></tr>
</table>
{% endblock %}
